Gate Runner sound effects and music
=====================================

All files in this directory were synthesized by `scripts/generate-audio.mjs`
for this project. They are original, contain no sampled recordings, and are
dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal.

https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

You can copy, modify, and redistribute them, including in a shipped app.
